&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/6/c/16c0fa6ced943d98b550de59c682479f99d2e3f2.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/3fhXpFalgsyLmSysyB8rwRgdk8W.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/6/c/16c0fa6ced943d98b550de59c682479f99d2e3f2_2_320x250.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;3fhXpFalgsyLmSysyB8rwRgdk8W&quot; width=&quot;320&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/6/c/16c0fa6ced943d98b550de59c682479f99d2e3f2_2_320x250.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/6/c/16c0fa6ced943d98b550de59c682479f99d2e3f2_2_480x375.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/6/c/16c0fa6ced943d98b550de59c682479f99d2e3f2_2_640x500.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;C5C8CD&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/b/d/ebdf40adf1540d356dc3db5cf6cebd9d09361198.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/xECwnbBApCDjOEOItEWUAGhgvEs.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/b/d/ebdf40adf1540d356dc3db5cf6cebd9d09361198_2_668x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;xECwnbBApCDjOEOItEWUAGhgvEs&quot; width=&quot;668&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/b/d/ebdf40adf1540d356dc3db5cf6cebd9d09361198_2_668x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/b/d/ebdf40adf1540d356dc3db5cf6cebd9d09361198_2_1002x750.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/b/d/ebdf40adf1540d356dc3db5cf6cebd9d09361198_2_1336x1000.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;FCFCFC&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;其实就是这个AI接入了iMessage，方便苹果用户傻瓜式操作，注册需要科学，后续聊天、生图啥的不需要，官网没河蟹，如果跳转到web版也是正常使用的。目前Pro服务只是多了一些自动化任务权益，生图和聊天完全不需要Pro服务&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://poke.com/apple-messages&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/4/e/9/4e9b601b5d7a9d762c7bde63ca4ed2c80d96aaa6.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;537393&quot; width=&quot;64&quot; height=&quot;64&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://poke.com/apple-messages&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;poke.com&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://poke.com/apple-messages&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Poke&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;The proactive AI assistant in your iMessage, WhatsApp, and more. Texts like a human, really knows you, and integrates with your life in dozens of ways.&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;onebox-metadata&quot;&gt;
    
    
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;

&lt;p&gt;助手设置（头像、订阅…）：&lt;a href=&quot;https://poke.com/settings/messaging&quot; class=&quot;inline-onebox&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Poke&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;定制头像：复制助手的电话号码——新建联系人——自定义姓名和头像&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;7 个帖子 - 5 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
