            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/5/a/05a93b0fe506a7582e5330989c1eb92c13dfdbdb.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/O4XFLGX3DH8fPsVuGTRSA3YCmv.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/5/a/05a93b0fe506a7582e5330989c1eb92c13dfdbdb_2_690x396.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;O4XFLGX3DH8fPsVuGTRSA3YCmv&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;396&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/5/a/05a93b0fe506a7582e5330989c1eb92c13dfdbdb_2_690x396.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/5/a/05a93b0fe506a7582e5330989c1eb92c13dfdbdb_2_1035x594.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/5/a/05a93b0fe506a7582e5330989c1eb92c13dfdbdb_2_1380x792.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;19181B&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/2/3/d23a763f1f4ea96a06299148bf4eac7e080330c9.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/tZLwpN85q9JHCOtfgrHSLBanBd7.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/3/d23a763f1f4ea96a06299148bf4eac7e080330c9_2_690x240.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;tZLwpN85q9JHCOtfgrHSLBanBd7&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;240&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/3/d23a763f1f4ea96a06299148bf4eac7e080330c9_2_690x240.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/3/d23a763f1f4ea96a06299148bf4eac7e080330c9_2_1035x360.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/3/d23a763f1f4ea96a06299148bf4eac7e080330c9_2_1380x480.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F7F7F7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;经测试：&lt;br&gt;
招行的VISA信用卡无效。（注：上个月可以正常开通，这个月好像不行了）。&lt;br&gt;
招行的银联信用卡也无效。&lt;br&gt;
招行的万事达信用卡可以正常开通。&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;24 个帖子 - 16 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2313893&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
