    <item>
      <title>支付宝积分兑换B站大会员月卡</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2310658</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2310658</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 08:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;打开支付宝，点击我的→支付宝会员→仔细看会有一个“&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/magnifying_glass_tilted_left.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:magnifying_glass_tilted_left:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:magnifying_glass_tilted_left:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt;搜索”→去搜索“哔哩哔哩”向下滑就能找到大会员月卡。填写手机号就可以到账。&lt;br&gt;
